    "title": "LA General Medical Center Seeks Help Identifying John Doe Found in Lincoln Heights - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Contributing Editor ,\n7 days ago Authorities sought the public’s help Wednesday in identifying a hospitalized patient who was found on the street in Lincoln Heights. The man, who appears to be 40 to 50 years old, has been at Los Angeles General Medical Center since Sept. 10, according to the L.A. County Department of Health Services, which runs the hospital. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
